# Local QA evidence and internal phase material are not part of the public source release.
artifacts/
.codex-remote-attachments/
docs/*.pdf
docs/implementation_baseline.md
docs/phase*.md
docs/data/
docs/design/
docs/usability/

# Local PDF review artifacts.
tmp/

